# CHANGELOG.md gets one entry per PR; under a moving main every rebase used to re-conflict
# on it. Entries now live as per-PR files in changelog.d/ (folded at release), but the union
# driver keeps BOTH sides' added lines so any direct edit during the transition still resolves.
CHANGELOG.md merge=union
